      "body": "On gfx1250, read the mHC projection weight transposed at the cross-layer boundary (`deepseek_v4_boundary.py`) and in the platform decoder stage (`deepseek_v4_platform_stage.py`), matching how it is stored.\n\n<!-- results -->\n### Accuracy\nGSM8K (200 questions, greedy), DeepSeek-V4-Pro: TP4 0.965.\n\n### Performance\nSetup:\n- Model: DeepSeek-V4-Pro, BF16 KV cache, DSPARK speculative decoding (block 6, 1 step)\n- Parallelism: TP4 (`--tp 4`, CP prefill + CP decode attention)\n- Step time: torch profiler on rank 0, GPU time per step; decode = 8 steps at 4 running requests (VERIFY = target verify, DRAFT = DSPARK draft), prefill = one EXTEND step of an ~8k-token prompt (TP4) / 4k (EP4)\n- Comparison: with vs without this PR, same image and node, all earlier PRs of the series applied\n\nWithout this PR the server does not start on gfx1250 (the TileLang `mhc_fused_post_pre` fails to build). With it, decode VERIFY 17.77 ms, DRAFT 1.83 ms, prefill 191.9 ms per step.\n<!-- /results -->\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:no_entry_sign: [Run #41766885003](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41766885003)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41766884709](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41766884709)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:hourglass_flowing_sand: [Run #41766884546](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41766884546)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-state